WEBVTT

00:03.580 --> 00:08.647
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:13.247 --> 00:16.447
- Whoo! Yeah!
- 呼！是的！

00:16.514 --> 00:19.247
Uh-huh, uh-huh!
嗯嗯嗯！

00:21.147 --> 00:23.814
Uh-huh!
嗯嗯！

00:31.247 --> 00:32.380
Ooh!
哦！

00:32.447 --> 00:34.314
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:34.380 --> 00:38.114
Uh-huh!
嗯嗯！

00:38.180 --> 00:41.047
- SpongeBob, I need--
-海绵宝宝，我需要--

00:41.114 --> 00:42.580
Whoa.
Sponge--
哇哦。
海绵 -

00:45.314 --> 00:46.514
- Patty, no!
- 帕蒂，不！

00:49.347 --> 00:52.014
- Oh, I can't quite reach it.
- 哦，我不太够得着。

01:04.880 --> 01:06.847
Listen here, boy-o!
听着，小伙子！

01:06.914 --> 01:08.580
As long as that patty's stuck
in the chimney,
只要那个馅饼卡住了
在烟囱里，

01:08.647 --> 01:09.947
it's money outta me pocket!
这是我口袋里的钱！

01:10.014 --> 01:11.547
You're gonna have to
go up there
你将不得不
上去那里

01:11.614 --> 01:13.280
and fish it out.
- Oh, boy!
然后把它捞出来。
- 哦，孩子！

01:13.347 --> 01:15.980
Looks like I'm taking my career
to new heights.
看来我要放弃我的职业生涯了
达到新的高度。

01:20.580 --> 01:21.814
Meep!
米普！

01:21.814 --> 01:22.980
All right, chimney,
好吧，烟囱，

01:23.047 --> 01:25.347
prepare to be swept.
准备被横扫。

01:25.414 --> 01:28.347
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:31.814 --> 01:33.080
There you are!
你在那里！

01:36.280 --> 01:39.047
Good as new!
完好如新！

01:44.514 --> 01:45.547
crowd:
人群：

01:45.614 --> 01:47.614
Hold on, patty!
坚持住，帕蒂！

01:47.680 --> 01:49.280
I've got you!
我有你！

01:52.280 --> 01:55.280
No!
不！

01:59.547 --> 02:00.980
- Okay, SpongeBob.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝。

02:01.047 --> 02:02.880
Time to come back down
and get to work
是时候回来了
并开始工作

02:02.947 --> 02:06.247
so I can garnish your wages
for wasting that patty!
这样我就可以扣押你的工资
浪费那个馅饼！

02:12.580 --> 02:13.680
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:22.014 --> 02:23.214
- Oh, you know,
I think I'll just
- 哦，你知道，
我想我只会

02:23.280 --> 02:24.414
stay up here a while.
在这里呆一会儿。

02:24.480 --> 02:25.980
It's such a nice day, and all.
这真是美好的一天，等等。

02:26.047 --> 02:29.814
- Nonsense, boy-o.
Just climb on down!
- 废话，小伙子。
就这样爬下去吧！

02:29.847 --> 02:31.814
No, I'm good!
不，我很好！

02:31.880 --> 02:33.347
- SpongeBob,
- 海绵宝宝，

02:33.414 --> 02:35.814
I order you to come down here
immediately!
我命令你到这里来
立即！

02:35.814 --> 02:37.814
- Don't worry,
I'll get him down
- 别担心，
我会把他弄下来

02:37.814 --> 02:41.514
with my newest invention:
Extend-O-Boots.
我的最新发明：
延长 O 形靴。

02:41.580 --> 02:43.547
I just press this button, and...
我只要按下这个按钮，然后...

02:43.614 --> 02:46.447
Whoa!
哇！

02:48.447 --> 02:52.114
- Sorry, I haven't worked out
all the kinks yet.
- 抱歉，我还没练好
所有的问题还没有解决。

02:52.180 --> 02:55.247
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Whoa-oh-oh!
哇哇哇！
哇哦哦！

02:57.414 --> 02:58.514
- Whoa!
- What the--
- 哇！
- 什么是--

03:00.847 --> 03:02.447
- So, uh...
- 那么，呃...

03:02.514 --> 03:04.347
anybody else got an idea?
还有其他人有想法吗？

03:04.414 --> 03:06.347
- It's okay, I got him!
- 没关系，我找到他了！

03:11.014 --> 03:13.447
- Hey, SpongeBob.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

03:13.514 --> 03:17.147
Whatcha doing wa
娃在做什么

03:18.647 --> 03:20.380
Let's climb down now.
我们现在就爬下去吧。

03:22.080 --> 03:24.447
Aw, thanks, Patrick,
but you go on ahead.
噢，谢谢，帕特里克，
但你继续前进。

03:24.514 --> 03:26.814
I just can't do it.
我就是做不到。

03:26.847 --> 03:28.380
It's too far down!
太差了！

03:28.447 --> 03:30.114
- Aw, don't worry, SpongeBob.
- 噢，别担心，海绵宝宝。

03:30.180 --> 03:32.814
Your old pal Patrick has
another plan
你的老朋友帕特里克有
另一个计划

03:32.847 --> 03:34.947
to get you off this roof.
让你离开这个屋顶。

03:35.014 --> 03:38.680
Sure.
Just do what I do.
当然。
就做我做的事吧。

03:38.814 --> 03:40.247
Hm...
嗯...

03:41.847 --> 03:44.014
Ow!
噢！

03:44.080 --> 03:47.547
- Uh, never mind, Patrick.
I think I'll stay where I am.
- 呃，没关系，帕特里克。
我想我会留在原地。

03:50.814 --> 03:53.414
[crowd chattering
disapprovingly]
[众人议论纷纷
不以为然地]

03:55.880 --> 03:58.380
Hey, it's not so bad up here.
嘿，这里没那么糟糕。

03:58.447 --> 03:59.814
Pretty great, really.
非常棒，真的。

03:59.847 --> 04:02.047
I sure do miss my friends,
though.
我确实很想念我的朋友们
不过。

04:02.114 --> 04:05.214
Hey, maybe I can see them
from up here.
嘿，也许我可以看到他们
从这里。

04:09.880 --> 04:11.914
Ooh, looks like
Squidward has a date.
哦哦，看起来像
章鱼哥有个约会。

04:11.980 --> 04:14.180
Good for him.
It can be so tough
对他有好处。
它可以如此艰难

04:14.247 --> 04:16.214
to put yourself out there.
把自己放在那里。

04:16.280 --> 04:17.814
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

04:17.814 --> 04:18.947
Poor Squidward.
可怜的章鱼哥。

04:19.014 --> 04:20.980
He's all alone!
他孤身一人！

04:21.047 --> 04:23.280
Ah!
啊!

04:23.347 --> 04:26.280
Don't worry, friend.
I'm here for you.
别担心，朋友。
我在这里等你。

04:29.347 --> 04:30.980
Hm?
Oh!
嗯？
哦！

04:31.047 --> 04:35.414
Oh!
Oh, that feels good.
哦！
哦，感觉很好。

04:35.480 --> 04:36.814
Huh?!
啊？！

04:39.247 --> 04:41.514
- Hmm, maybe he's hungry.
- 嗯，也许他饿了。

04:41.580 --> 04:43.280
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:46.114 --> 04:47.514
- Come on, Squidward!
Eat your...
- 来吧，章鱼哥！
吃你的...

04:47.580 --> 04:48.947
- Ow, hand cramp!
- 哎呀，手抽筋了！

04:51.680 --> 04:53.380
Ow-ow-ow-ow!
噢-噢-噢-噢！

04:53.447 --> 04:55.114
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:03.814 --> 05:05.814
- Guess he wasn't hungry
after all.
- 我猜他不饿
毕竟。

05:07.814 --> 05:10.314
- I guess there's nothing left
to do but go to sleep.
-我想已经什么都没有剩下了
要做的事情就是去睡觉。

05:13.314 --> 05:16.480
Oh, I wish I had my bed...
哦，我希望我有一张床......

05:18.047 --> 05:20.180
Hey, that gives me an idea.
嘿，这给了我一个主意。

05:24.047 --> 05:27.814
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:29.580 --> 05:32.714
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:32.814 --> 05:33.880
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

05:35.547 --> 05:36.947
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

05:41.347 --> 05:45.614
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:45.680 --> 05:48.014
Perfect.
完美的。

05:48.080 --> 05:49.547
Good night...
晚安...

05:51.280 --> 05:52.714
nobody.
没有人。

06:00.947 --> 06:03.047
- Yoo-hoo, SpongeBob!
- 哟吼，海绵宝宝！

06:03.114 --> 06:07.380
Time to wake up!
- Oh, morning, Mr. Krabs.
是时候醒来了！
- 哦，早上好，蟹老板。

06:07.447 --> 06:09.480
I've come up with a solution
我想出了一个解决方案

06:09.547 --> 06:11.947
for your little roof problem,
boy-o!
对于你的屋顶小问题，
男孩哦！

06:17.547 --> 06:20.980
- Now you can cook even if
you can't get back down.
- 现在你可以做饭了，即使
你不能再下来了。

06:25.680 --> 06:27.180
Oh, thank you, Mr. Krabs.
哦，谢谢你，蟹老板。

06:27.247 --> 06:29.714
- Now start making me money!
- 现在开始赚钱！

06:29.814 --> 06:32.880
- Oh, Grilly, I thought
I'd never see you again!
-哦，格里利，我想
我再也见不到你了！

06:34.414 --> 06:36.047
Something still doesn't feel
right, though.
仍然感觉不到什么
是的，不过。

06:40.714 --> 06:42.080
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:46.814 --> 06:48.347
[drill whirring,
SpongeBob grunting]
[钻头呼呼地响，
海绵宝宝咕哝]

06:48.414 --> 06:52.380
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:52.447 --> 06:56.247
Perfect!
Just like my old kitchen.
完美的！
就像我的旧厨房一样。

06:58.647 --> 07:03.347
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:03.414 --> 07:04.847
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

07:06.514 --> 07:09.180
Squidward, order's up!
章鱼哥，命令已定！

07:09.247 --> 07:12.147
Oh, yeah.
I'm stuck up on this roof.
哦，是的。
我被困在这个屋顶上了。

07:12.214 --> 07:14.180
Hmm...how do I get
these patties
嗯...我怎样才能得到
这些肉饼

07:14.247 --> 07:15.880
down to the customers?
到客户？

07:18.814 --> 07:20.214
Eureka!
尤里卡！

07:20.280 --> 07:22.280
- We paid for patties, Krabs!
- 蟹蟹们，我们付了肉饼的钱！

07:22.347 --> 07:25.080
Where's our food?
- Hey, calm down, everyone.
我们的食物在哪里？
- 嘿，大家冷静点。

07:25.147 --> 07:27.447
I'm sure we can figure
something out
我相信我们能想到
出了点什么

07:27.514 --> 07:31.247
that doesn't involve violence
or...refunds.
不涉及暴力
或...退款。

07:31.314 --> 07:35.114
- Hey, outside!
It's raining Krabby Patties!
- 嘿，外面！
蟹肉饼下雨了！

07:35.180 --> 07:37.114
Squidward and Krabs: Huh?
章鱼哥和蟹蟹：啊？

07:39.980 --> 07:42.447
- Safe!
- 安全的！

07:42.514 --> 07:46.547
- I'll take one Krabby Patty
and a drink, please.
- 我要一份蟹肉饼
请喝一杯。

07:46.614 --> 07:48.480
I said, "And a drink!"
我说：“还有一杯饮料！”

07:54.380 --> 07:56.180
These are cold!
这些很冷！

07:56.247 --> 07:58.180
I paid for a hot meal.
我付了一顿热饭的钱。

07:58.247 --> 07:59.814
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

07:59.880 --> 08:02.847
- Maybe if we go up there,
we can get 'em fresh!
-也许如果我们去那里的话
我们可以让它们新鲜！

08:02.914 --> 08:05.480
To the roof!
all: Yeah!
到屋顶！
全体：是啊！

08:05.547 --> 08:08.314
- Whoa!
I better make more room up here.
- 哇！
我最好在这里腾出更多空间。

08:10.747 --> 08:12.547
- You know, boy-o,
- 你知道，男孩，

08:12.614 --> 08:16.014
at first I just thought
you were being a lily-livered,
起初我只是想
你本来就是百合花，

08:16.080 --> 08:17.714
spineless, cry-baby,
scaredy-pants,
没有骨气，爱哭鬼，
吓人的裤子，

08:17.780 --> 08:19.314
invertebrate loser.
无脊椎动物的失败者。

08:19.380 --> 08:21.280
- But this rooftop restaurant
of yours
- 但这家屋顶餐厅
你的

08:21.347 --> 08:23.447
really has me business booming!
真是让我生意兴隆啊！

08:23.514 --> 08:25.180
- Wish you could've
- 但愿你能

08:25.247 --> 08:26.914
talked Squidward into
joining us up here.
说服章鱼哥
加入我们吧。

08:28.414 --> 08:31.547
Finally, this place
has some class.
最后，这个地方
有一些课。

08:31.614 --> 08:34.080
I might actually enjoy
working here now.
我可能真的很喜欢
现在在这里工作。

08:41.347 --> 08:43.614
- Ten more patties, SpongeBob!
- 还有十块肉饼，海绵宝宝！

08:43.680 --> 08:45.680
- You got it, Mr. K.
- 你明白了，K先生。

08:47.980 --> 08:49.514
- Aw...
- 噢...

08:51.147 --> 08:52.880
- No, no--me money!
- 不，不——我的钱！

08:55.014 --> 08:57.880
- Being outside is awful!
- 呆在外面太糟糕了！

08:59.614 --> 09:01.414
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:02.980 --> 09:04.447
But we're under--
但我们正处于——

09:04.514 --> 09:07.114
- Wait, wait, don't go!
- 等等，等等，别走！

09:07.180 --> 09:08.614
A little wind
有一点风

09:08.680 --> 09:10.647
never hurt anyone!
永远不要伤害任何人！

09:10.714 --> 09:12.680
- Whoa, whoa!
- 哇，哇！

09:15.714 --> 09:17.180
Ow!
噢！

09:17.247 --> 09:19.947
SpongeBob, we're losing 'em.
Do something!
海绵宝宝，我们正在失去他们。
做点什么吧！

09:20.014 --> 09:21.614
- Aye-aye, sir!
- 是啊，先生！

09:24.680 --> 09:31.714
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:35.380 --> 09:37.847
- It's beautiful, boy-o!
- 很漂亮，男孩！

09:37.914 --> 09:41.814
- Yeah, it's pretty nice,
but now that we're not outside,
- 是的，这很漂亮，
但现在我们不在外面

09:41.847 --> 09:44.180
I'm starting to get bored.
- Yeah, so...
我开始感到无聊了。
- 是的，所以...

09:47.880 --> 09:50.680
- Wait!
You can't be bored
- 等待！
你不能感到无聊

09:50.814 --> 09:54.480
when there's dancing!
当有跳舞的时候！

09:54.547 --> 09:56.814
[electronic dance
music playing]
[电子舞曲
音乐播放]

09:56.880 --> 09:58.580
Whoo!
呼！

09:58.647 --> 10:02.480
[grunting and shouting
rhythmically]
[咕哝和喊叫
有节奏地]

10:02.547 --> 10:05.580
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:05.647 --> 10:07.614
- He's right!
- 他是对的！

10:07.814 --> 10:14.814
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:29.047 --> 10:31.547
- Hooray!
We're not on the roof anymore.
- 万岁！
我们不再在屋顶上了。

10:31.614 --> 10:33.280
- You know, after all
that dancing
- 毕竟你知道
那个跳舞

10:33.347 --> 10:35.680
and partying today,
tomorrow's gonna feel
今天还有聚会，
明天会感觉

10:35.814 --> 10:38.447
like starting a new business!
- And I'm looking forward
就像开始一项新业务一样！
- 我很期待

10:38.514 --> 10:40.980
to getting in
on the ground floor with you!
进入
和你一起在一楼！

10:45.414 --> 10:46.814
Time to go home already?
已经到回家的时间了吗？

10:51.347 --> 10:52.880
Ow.
噢。

11:00.880 --> 11:07.980
* *
**
**
**

**